    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d664">

                <pb facs="0645" n="1379" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1379"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Dec. 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 708.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose copy of a note just received from
                    Sir Philip Currie, British ambassador, informing me that the missionaries at
                    Bitlis still regard their condition as critical, as he is informed through his
                    consul at Erzerum.</p>
                <p>Their condition now is a realization of my fears, expressed to your Department
                    nearly a year ago, on account of their humane but indiscreet action in visiting
                    and assisting the investigating commission. It was most natural, but most
                    unfortunate. Every effort that is possible with me has already been exerted for
                    their protection. Safe conduct was ordered on their request to go to Van, and
                    then apparently declined.</p>
                <p>There is now much reason to fear that they will be sacrificed. * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d664-a1.xml" xpointer="d664-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
